{
  "name" : "FatehiChenar2018 - Mathematical model of immune response to hepatitis B",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This is a mathematical model describing the dynamics of the immune response to hepatitis B, which takes into account contributions form innate and adaptive immune responses, as well as cytokines.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
